{"body":{"says":"The grade given to something said. The author's practice, which he calls using measures: when something is said it is given a measure, such as that it is not yet owned by the build structure, and a value, and graded, so that what matters is not forgotten and its words stay as they were said. A measure need not be concluded: it is there to reason with, so that a session can say what is to be read and what is not."},"id":"01M6W3V08ESHZH4GN614H6XRAG","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"as":{"says":"What it is measured by, as the author would name it: marked, as a reader marks a book; not yet owned by the build structure; or verbatim.","shape":"string"},"by":{"holds":false,"says":"The voice that measured it.","shape":"ref"},"note":{"optional":true,"says":"Why it was marked, in a few words: a note in the margin, written with curiosity rather than as one who knows what is good.","shape":"string"},"of":{"holds":false,"says":"What was said that is measured: a whole, as a session, an utterance, a paragraph or a sentence; with a range, the whole the run lies within.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"owned":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The brief that already holds what was said, where the structure owns it; unsaid where nothing built owns it yet.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"range":{"optional":true,"says":"Where the mark falls on a run of the whole's parts rather than the whole: from the first part to the last, in the whole's order.","shape":{"from":"ref","to":"ref"}},"thread":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The thread that takes it in, where one does.","shape":"ref"},"value":{"says":"Its grade: 3 not to be forgotten, 2 steers what is built, 1 noted. A scale for now, the author's to change.","shape":"number"}},"name":"measure","prev":"sha256-c7e528cd5145f011ce4b0a41ea5819aa2a3a785d8a6b2199f3e998fcfa0dde69"}
